{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-js","path":"/blog/2024-12-20-how-to-use-datepicker-in-react-js/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"excerpt":"Hi Friends 👋, Welcome To aHoisting! To use datepicker you have to import  from  that’s how you can use datepicker in react js. Today, I am going to show you…","html":"<p>Hi Friends 👋,</p>\n<p>Welcome To aHoisting!</p>\n<p>To use datepicker you have to import <code class=\"language-text\">datepicker</code> from <code class=\"language-text\">'react-datepicker'</code> that’s how you can use datepicker in react js.</p>\n<p>Today, I am going to show you, how to use datepicker in react js.</p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<p>Install the following packages to use react-datepicker in react js.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">npm</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">npm install react<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>datepicker\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">yarn</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">yarn add react<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>datepicker\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Table of contents</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Install and create a new React app.</li>\n<li>Import react component.</li>\n<li>Create a Component.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let’s start with the first step.</p>\n<h2>Step 1: Install and create a new React app.</h2>\n<p>First you have to install the React project. You should use <code class=\"language-text\">create-react-app</code> command to create a new React project.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">npx create<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>react<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\ncd my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\nnpm start</code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 2: Import react component.</h2>\n<p>After installing, you have to import your React component.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> useState <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> DatePicker <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react-datepicker'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react-datepicker/dist/react-datepicker.css'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 3: Create a Component.</h2>\n<p>You can use <code class=\"language-text\">dateFormat=\"yyyy/MM/dd\"</code> to use datepicker in react js.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>h3<span class=\"token operator\">></span>Select a Date<span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>h3<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>DatePicker\n        selected<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>startDate<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        onChange<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">date</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token function\">setStartDate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>date<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// Callback to update the state</span>\n        dateFormat<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"yyyy/MM/dd\"</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// Optional: Set the desired date format</span>\n        isClearable <span class=\"token comment\">// Optional: Show a clear button</span>\n        placeholderText<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Select a date\"</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// Optional: Placeholder text</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Use datepicker example.</h2>\n<p>The below code is an example of a React. You have to import <code class=\"language-text\">react</code> and <code class=\"language-text\">'react-datepicker'</code> to use datepicker in react js.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">App.js</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> useState <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> DatePicker <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react-datepicker'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react-datepicker/dist/react-datepicker.css'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// Import the CSS file</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">App</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>startDate<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> setStartDate<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">useState</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Date</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>h3<span class=\"token operator\">></span>Select a Date<span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>h3<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>DatePicker\n        selected<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>startDate<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        onChange<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">date</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token function\">setStartDate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>date<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// Callback to update the state</span>\n        dateFormat<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"yyyy/MM/dd\"</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// Optional: Set the desired date format</span>\n        isClearable <span class=\"token comment\">// Optional: Show a clear button</span>\n        placeholderText<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Select a date\"</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// Optional: Placeholder text</span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> App<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>In the above code example, I have used the <code class=\"language-text\">'react-datepicker'</code> to use datepicker in react js.</p>\n<p>Check the output of the above code.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 351px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/9eb8a0eecfc3c413209c81d5eeee5f46/a9e07/use-datepicker.webp\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 125.9493670886076%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/webp;base64,UklGRn4AAABXRUJQVlA4IHIAAADwAwCdASoUABkAPtFSo0woJCMiMBgMAQAaCWUAAC5W3gPIcWh7WjUAAMtPwS/mcABQ8zZy84HdQvTwSqTVaOJ+h7lycnLf9mej7MPJ+pjkAARC9Dp2/W7uHctAag5+DGO/obTrYHHtfilZ+U4BxKAAAAA='); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"React, use, datepicker\"\n        title=\"React, use, datepicker\"\n        src=\"/static/9eb8a0eecfc3c413209c81d5eeee5f46/a9e07/use-datepicker.webp\"\n        srcset=\"/static/9eb8a0eecfc3c413209c81d5eeee5f46/81b7c/use-datepicker.webp 158w,\n/static/9eb8a0eecfc3c413209c81d5eeee5f46/6ea66/use-datepicker.webp 315w,\n/static/9eb8a0eecfc3c413209c81d5eeee5f46/a9e07/use-datepicker.webp 351w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 351px) 100vw, 351px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>All the best 👍</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"How to use datepicker in react js?","tags":["React"],"date":"December 20, 2024","description":"Example of use datepicker in react js with step by step tutorial - aHoisting","social_image":{"absolutePath":"/Users/mac/Documents/hoisting/ahoisting/static/media/template/reactjs.jpg"}}},"prev":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to use drag and drop in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-12-20-how-to-use-drag-and-drop-in-react-js/"}},"next":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to use delay in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-12-19-how-to-use-delay-in-react-js/"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/blog/2024-12-20-how-to-use-datepicker-in-react-js/","prevSlug":"/blog/2024-12-20-how-to-use-drag-and-drop-in-react-js/","nextSlug":"/blog/2024-12-19-how-to-use-delay-in-react-js/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2555585279","2714594843","3159585216"]}